## Why This Is Asked

Assesses end-to-end real-time ingestion, deduplication guarantees, and exactly-once semantics across regional boundaries. Tests Dataflow configuration (watermarks, lateness), BigQuery writes with insertId, and robust monitoring.

## Key Concepts

- Dataflow streaming and Pub/Sub in multi-region setups
- Stateful deduplication by event_id
- BigQuery insertId for idempotent sinks
- Watermarking and allowed lateness
- Cloud Monitoring alerts and incident wiring
- IAM least privilege and service accounts

## Code Example

```java
class DedupDoFn extends DoFn<Event, Event> {
  @StateId("seen") private final StateSpec<ValueState<Boolean>> seen = null;
  @ProcessElement
  public void process(@Element Event e, @StateId("seen") ValueState<Boolean> seen) {
    if (Boolean.FALSE.equals(seen.read())) {
      seen.write(true);
      out.output(e);
    }
  }
}
```

